The code in this directory is ported from pixman 0.46.4, the pixel
library X.org's server draws RENDER with
(https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pixman/pixman): pixman-access.c,
pixman-bits-image.c, pixman-combine32.c, pixman-combine-float.c,
pixman-conical-gradient.c, pixman-edge.c, pixman-general.c,
pixman-glyph.c, pixman-gradient-walker.c, pixman-image.c,
pixman-linear-gradient.c, pixman-matrix.c, pixman-radial-gradient.c,
pixman-trap.c, pixman-utils.c and pixman.c. src/xrender.rs ports X.org's
RENDER code around it (xserver 21.1.22: render/render.c, picture.c,
mipict.c, mirect.c, miindex.c, glyph.c, filter.c, animcur.c; fb/fbpict.c,
fbtrap.c). Their notices follow; they apply to the ported code.

